<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/pointcloud#RangeDatatypeShape> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A reusable validation contract for apc:pointCount. apc:pointCount takes an integer within the xsd:unsignedLong value space (rdfs:range xsd:unsignedLong)."@en .
