<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/pointcloud#pointCount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The declared number of points in an unstructured point collection, including zero for an empty collection."@en .
<https://hexplain.io/ns/aspect/pointcloud#pointCount> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Use for unstructured sampled-point collections and their per-point record descriptions; no regular grid topology is implied. Use it as a predicate. Applicable SHACL paths and their focus-node scopes are listed below; no additional global domain is inferred from that usage."@en .
